    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρῐ-</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, insep. prefix, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρι-</span>
			, strengthening the notion conveyed by its compd.: cogn. with
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρείων, ἄριστος,</span> chiefly
			denoting <i>goodness, excellence</i>: mostly in older 
				Ep.
			 and Lyr.</div>
